# Credit Risk Prediction System

An AI-powered Credit Risk Prediction System built using FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, and Machine Learning.

This system predicts whether a borrower is likely to default on a loan and categorizes the applicant into different risk levels.

---

# Features Added

## Authentication System
- JWT-based authentication
- User registration and login
- Google OAuth login integration
- Protected backend routes using JWT
- Persistent login using localStorage

## Frontend Improvements
- Added authentication flow
- Added protected dashboard access
- Added profile section in navbar
- Added logout functionality
- Added prediction history table
- Added loading states and error handling

## Backend Improvements
- Protected `/predict` endpoint
- Protected `/history` endpoint
- Linked predictions with authenticated users
- Added Google OAuth verification
- Added JWT token generation and validation
- Added user-specific prediction history

## Database Changes
- Added `User` model
- Linked `Prediction` table with users using `user_id`
- Added authentication-related schemas and routes

---

# Tech Stack

## Frontend
- React
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Axios
- React Router
- Google OAuth

## Backend
- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy
- PostgreSQL
- JWT Authentication
- Google OAuth
- Pydantic

## Machine Learning
- XGBoost
- Scikit-learn
- Pandas
- NumPy

